                                "sense_id": "b54c1bbd-7305-3366-b328-f61316d8c573",
                                "text": "[…] it's a good thing for she to get a husbind that can give her a goulden coach to ride in, if she's got a mind to it. But there, her pretty face is wuth a tummal of money[…]"
